{
  "entities": [
    {
      "attributes": {
        "description": null,
        "external_dependencies": null,
        "path": "opsdir/opsdir/domains/governance/",
        "purpose": "Owners (parties: parties.py display_name/operator/operator_label), change records, incidents and work instructions; import runs keyed by importer + environment/shared + scope set (imports.py: run_dn, scope_set_key, runs_covering, reports imports and import-scopes, check_import_runs with fix imports/scope-set-names for legacy-named runs) and collection attempts; the unknowns register (ciamUnknown questions the planner counts: check_unknowns, report unknowns); ITSM ticket evidence (tickets.py: ciamTicketRef on ciamChange, observed ciamTicket under ou=<adapter>,ou=tickets, drift states, check_tickets, report tickets; never an approval); stale-runbook view and report."
      },
      "kind": "modules",
      "op": "modify",
      "semantic_key": {
        "name": "domain-governance"
      }
    },
    {
      "attributes": {
        "ai_generated": 1,
        "confidence_score": 0.0,
        "description": "Every applied import records what it read as data, under the same approved change: an import run entry (ou=imports) naming the importer, the scopes it read (subtree roots, kept even when the export deleted everything under one), when the export was taken, the change that applied it and, for a live collection, how opsdir collected it. A run is one importer's read of one scope set in one environment (or shared), named by a digest of the canonical set: the same set again replaces its run, another set records its own run beside it, so earlier coverage stays. Readers: the prerequisite proof for fixes (the newest single run covering every entry a fix needs, taken after anyone else's last change to them), the firewall read-back's 'last read' dates, and the imports and import-scopes reports. Runs still named by importer and environment only are a plan action whose assisted fix renames them as they were under an approved change. Failed collections are separate attempt entries and never count as runs."
      },
      "kind": "flows",
      "op": "modify",
      "semantic_key": {
        "name": "Import Run Receipts"
      }
    },
