        "purpose": "The DN of an importer's run of one scope set, all in one environment or none: cn=<adapter>.<importer>.<environment (normalized) or shared>.<scope_set_key>,ou=imports; ValueError when the scopes lie in more than one environment.",
        "returns": "{\"type\": \"str\", \"description\": \"the run's DN\"}",
